<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3515/20  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5930/40  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7903/13  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.3745/50  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     32.86/86   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.3789/04  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1550.5/1.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.90/95  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.9643/18  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.3885/55  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.0720/65  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4045/55  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7803/08  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7378/88  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6707/17</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$353.75/354.25</p>
</text>
